//MCQ

::Partitioner::
If we have 4 reducers in our MapReduce job, then what should be the number of partitioners?{
    ~1
    ~2
    ~3
    =4
}

::Partitioner::
Which of the following statement is wrong regarding partitioners?{
    ~ It is used to partition the mapper output. 
    ~ It is of same number as of reducer.
    = It reduces the processing work of reducer.
    ~ A user defined partitioner is also possible to create. 
} 

